# Atlas Core - Dashboard Density & Layout Token Refactoring Specification
**Author:** Ash Nkosi  
**Department:** Design  
**Project:** Atlas Core  
**Produced:** D17 15:45  
**Inputs used:** Business Document (Company Document)  
## Summary

Refactored the Atlas Core dashboard UI architecture from cluttered widget grids to a streamlined 8pt hierarchy, referencing Business Document: Company Document to align SaaS platform analytics and Face-to-Face booking workflows.

